data/
__pycache__/
.venv/
*.db
*.rdb
.env

# The 3D models live in one place, web-next/public/assets, and are committed (see
# README > Credits for the licences and attribution). web/assets is the vanilla console's
# copy of the same three files: Docker populates it from the committed set, and locally you
# copy them across once, so the binaries are not stored twice.
web/assets/*.glb

# Next.js
web-next/node_modules/
web-next/.next/
web-next/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
# The static export is a build output, and it copies public/ wholesale - including the
# third-party .glb models, which are not redistributed with this repo (see README > Credits).
web-next/out/
data/crashgraph.backup-*.db
